{"description":"Carefully renovated and decorated by our interior designers, this high-end apartment has been designed in the image of the neighborhood, chic and elegant with a touch of whimsy.The spaceThis exceptional serviced apartment welcomes you to rue Réaumur, in the highly sought-after Marais district. Offering a magnificent 90 sqm surface area, 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a sofa bed, this apartment can accommodate up to 8 people and is the ideal starting point for exploring the city.The living space, bathed in natural light, includes a lounge, a fully-equipped kitchen and a dining room, creating a warm and inviting environment ideal for relaxing, socializing or working.The tastefully decorated bedrooms include en-suite bathrooms with walk-in showers. The beds are of impeccable hotel quality, guaranteeing absolute comfort.A daily cleaning service is provided by our teams to guarantee you maximum comfort.Whether you're with family, friends or on a business trip, this luxurious setting will provide you with an incomparable setting for a memorable Parisian getaway.Enjoy your stay at HIGHSTAY.Guest accessYour arrival is autonomous: the door is equipped with a highly secure system with a connected entry code (no need for keys).Other things to noteFor your convenience, each apartment is fully equipped (see list of amenities). Upon your arrival, you will find still and sparkling water, as well as a selection of coffees and teas. Our concierge team is at your disposal for any request: private chauffeur transfers, grocery shopping, restaurant recommendations, guided tours, and any other bespoke services.","amenities":[{"title":"Hairdryer","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Cleaning products","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"AESOP shampoo","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"AESOP body soap","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hot water","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Shower gel","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Washing m